{title: Santa Bring My Baby Back To Me}
{artist: Elvis Presley}
{key: G}
{# Источник: ручной перенос с UG. TACET → N.C. }

{comment: Verse 1}
I don't [G]need a lot of presents to [C]make my Christmas [G]bright,
[C]I just need my baby's arms wound around me [G]tight.
[N.C.]Oh Santa,
[D7]Hear my plea. [C]Santa, bring my [D7]baby back to [G]me.

